00:09:02.942 --> 00:09:06.479 align:start size:97% position:3%
And it's just lost its
spirit, it's lost its soul.

00:09:06.479 --> 00:09:10.583
I think that people have
become allies of the state,

00:09:10.583 --> 00:09:11.784
you know?

00:09:11.784 --> 00:09:12.852 align:start size:84% position:16%
And now it's just
like a bunch of people

00:09:12.852 --> 00:09:14.620 align:start size:88% position:13%
who believe
politicians over there.

00:09:14.620 --> 00:09:17.490
They've lost that
fire, that energy

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.660
and the city doesn't read
the same that it used to,

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.195
it doesn't read like a
hub of cultural activity.

00:09:23.195 --> 00:09:24.397
I'm sorry, but it doesn't.

00:09:24.397 --> 00:09:27.300 align:start size:84% position:16%
It reads like a
crime infested area

00:09:27.300 --> 00:09:28.801 align:start size:84% position:16%
where you're afraid
to, you know,

00:09:28.801 --> 00:09:30.937 align:start size:84% position:16%
you don't wanna
build a family there

00:09:30.937 --> 00:09:32.572
because you're not only
worried about the crime,

00:09:32.572 --> 00:09:34.307
but you're worried
about the mandates,

00:09:34.307 --> 00:09:36.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
you're worried about what
happens in cycle two.

00:09:36.509 --> 00:09:39.278
We all know there's gonna be
a cycle two of this pandemic,

00:09:39.278 --> 00:09:41.681 align:start size:97% position:3%
it's coming, it's coming
and it's gonna be the masks.

00:09:41.681 --> 00:09:44.183
Maybe it'll come just in
time for the next election,

00:09:44.183 --> 00:09:45.651 align:start size:88% position:13%
who knows?
- You think, you think.

00:09:45.651 --> 00:09:47.820 align:start size:94% position:6%
- You'd think, but the
next time it rolls around,

00:09:47.820 --> 00:09:49.455
now, you know that, you know,

00:09:49.455 --> 00:09:50.690
you can look around the country

00:09:50.690 --> 00:09:52.925 align:start size:84% position:16%
and know where those
populations live,

00:09:52.925 --> 00:09:54.694 align:start size:88% position:13%
where they're just gonna
lie down and take it.

00:09:54.694 --> 00:09:57.296 align:start size:88% position:13%
Oh, you wanna shut
down my business? Okay.

00:09:57.296 --> 00:10:00.433
Oh, you wanna mandate
