stop transmission

00:10:02.401 --> 00:10:04.503
or I can't go into
a restaurant, okay.

00:10:04.503 --> 00:10:07.473
Like where is their
line in New York?

00:10:07.473 --> 00:10:09.675
Just in terms of making
decisions for themselves

00:10:09.675 --> 00:10:10.610
and their families.

00:10:10.610 --> 00:10:12.778
So I don't know what caused it,

00:10:12.778 --> 00:10:16.115 align:start size:94% position:6%
but now there's like a
subservience to authority.

00:10:16.115 --> 00:10:18.217
It's like, oh, you're in
