it's really, really crazy.

00:11:07.533 --> 00:11:10.069 align:start size:88% position:13%
A police force that
doesn't feel supported,

00:11:10.069 --> 00:11:11.671
it's just so many factors.

00:11:11.671 --> 00:11:13.472
And I love New York.

00:11:13.472 --> 00:11:15.608
So when I say it needs to sink,

00:11:15.608 --> 00:11:17.009
I say that from a place of love,

00:11:17.009 --> 00:11:19.478
like you need to
sink or you're not,

00:11:19.478 --> 00:11:21.814
that's gonna be your only
motivation to wake up.

00:11:21.814 --> 00:11:24.750
Maybe it'll wake up voters,
maybe it won't, I don't know.

00:11:24.750 --> 00:11:26.986 align:start size:97% position:3%
I think the people who flock
to cities like that now

00:11:26.986 --> 00:11:30.723 align:start position:0%
are perfectly comfortable
folding into a brave new world.

00:11:30.723 --> 00:11:32.191
They're comfortable with it.

00:11:32.191 --> 00:11:33.592
- Well, I'm so glad
that you said that,

00:11:33.592 --> 00:11:35.094
that you want it to come back,

00:11:35.094 --> 00:11:39.198
because I spent most of my
adult years in New York City.

00:11:39.198 --> 00:11:40.833 align:start size:84% position:16%
My grandparents lived
in New York City,

00:11:40.833 --> 00:11:42.068 align:start size:81% position:19%
although I grew
up in Long Island.

00:11:42.068 --> 00:11:43.836 align:start size:84% position:16% line:0%
So I was always going
to New York city.

00:11:43.836 --> 00:11:45.237 line:0%
I remember as a kid, I hated it

00:11:45.237 --> 00:11:46.639 line:0%
'cause I thought it was
this dirty, weird place.

00:11:46.639 --> 00:11:49.341 line:0%
And then as then I was
an adult and I loved it.

00:11:49.341 --> 00:11:51.944
I loved the grittiness and
the reality and the artists

00:11:51.944 --> 00:11:53.979
and all of the stuff
that was New York.

00:11:53.979 --> 00:11:55.448 align:start size:84% position:16%
And it just doesn't
happen anymore.

00:11:55.448 --> 00:11:58.184 align:start position:0%
Something you said before
that, about the dystopian part,

00:11:58.184 --> 00:12:00.386 align:start size:88% position:13%
it wasn't just the
