00:12:27.246 --> 00:12:29.348 align:start size:88% position:13%
how a certain
demonization of people,

00:12:29.348 --> 00:12:31.584
a certain you don't look
at other people as human.

00:12:31.584 --> 00:12:33.552
And I kind of felt
that weird thing,

00:12:33.552 --> 00:12:35.821
like no one was looking
at each other anymore.

00:12:35.821 --> 00:12:37.990
We were just these
orbs bouncing around

00:12:37.990 --> 00:12:40.292
