or the fruit section,

00:12:40.292 --> 00:12:41.494
and then go about our lives,

00:12:41.494 --> 00:12:43.829 align:start size:84% position:16%
and that is not
healthy for a society.

00:12:43.829 --> 00:12:46.298
- Yeah, and people just
bought into this fear

00:12:46.298 --> 00:12:49.935 align:start size:97% position:3%
so extensively that they
became afraid of other people.

00:12:49.935 --> 00:12:52.238 align:start size:97% position:3%
I mean, I remember watching
a clip on "The View"

00:12:52.238 --> 00:12:54.340
that went through my timeline,

00:12:54.340 --> 00:12:56.375
