00:13:12.958 --> 00:13:16.495
And it's also like, wow, that
told me something about her.

00:13:16.495 --> 00:13:18.430 align:start size:88% position:13%
And it told me something
about a lot of people

00:13:18.430 --> 00:13:21.901 align:start size:88% position:13%
that have her ideology,
her worldview,

00:13:21.901 --> 00:13:23.969 align:start size:84% position:16%
they're really
comfortable in a world

00:13:23.969 --> 00:13:25.304
