comfortable with that.

00:13:41.120 --> 00:13:42.721
They wanna be told what to do.

00:13:42.721 --> 00:13:44.690 align:start size:97% position:3%
They're uncomfortable
making their own decisions.

00:13:44.690 --> 00:13:46.826 align:start size:84% position:16%
They're uncomfortable
