00:16:45.838 --> 00:16:47.272
She defended that.

00:16:47.272 --> 00:16:49.475 align:start size:97% position:3%
I don't know if you remember
that show a while ago,

00:16:49.475 --> 00:16:51.310
I mean, it was before
