00:43:14.358 --> 00:43:16.794 align:start position:0%
because they've bought the
story, they've bought the story.

00:43:16.794 --> 00:43:19.229
So I think a lot of it is about,

00:43:19.229 --> 00:43:21.198
rejecting modern day feminism

00:43:21.198 --> 00:43:24.234
is about embracing
female empowerment.

00:43:24.234 --> 00:43:25.669
It's not about tearing it down.

00:43:25.669 --> 00:43:28.806 align:start size:97% position:3%
It's about saying you,
it's, you, you dress slutty,

00:43:28.806 --> 00:43:31.141 align:start size:94% position:6%
you attract the wrong kind
of guy, that's on you.

00:43:31.141 --> 00:43:32.309
That's on you.

00:43:32.309 --> 00:43:33.844 align:start size:88% position:13%
Own your own decisions,
your own choices,

00:43:33.844 --> 00:43:36.647
and what is the result of
those choices, own it all.

00:43:36.647 --> 00:43:38.182 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you'll feel some
control over your own life

00:43:38.182 --> 00:43:39.583
for a change.

